    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the onion, ginger paste, and garlic. Cook until translucent.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-saag-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54207-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Chicken-Saag-with-Cauliflower-Rice-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the spinach and cook until the spinach starts to wilt.",
