      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-saag-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54207-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Chicken-Saag-with-Cauliflower-Rice-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add this mixture to a blender and pulse until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-saag-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54207-step-0-4",
