    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare the chicken seasonings by combining the rest of the ghee, chili powder, turmeric, salt, and pepper in a bowl. Mix to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chicken-saag-with-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-54207-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Chicken-Saag-with-Cauliflower-Rice-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coat the chicken in this seasoning.",
